    "alt": "No Woman No Spice"
  },
  "intro": {
    "copy": "Behind every spice is a story. Too often, the women growing it are missing from the picture. For a Canadian company sourcing spices from women farmers in East Africa, we made those women the centre of the brand. Patterns inspired by scarves sent by the growers sit alongside bold portraits, connecting the product on the kitchen shelf to the people and places behind it. Packaging that makes the origin of every flavour impossible to overlook.",
    "title": "No Women. No Spice.",
    "subtitle": "Putting women at the heart of the spice trade.",
    "services": [
      "Visual Identity",
      "Art Direction",
      "Branding"
    ]
  },
